{\pard\sa160 Reviewers are asked whether the work is of interest under the published criteria; whether its claims are warranted was checked before they read, and the findings report tells them where it was not. Their signed judgment goes, with the editor's, to {\f1 ../3-editor/<paper>/interest.yaml} (H3).\par}
{\pard\sa160 {\f1 questions-before-priors/} holds round 1's review: the packet, and the two machine reviews of the July 23 draft filed as the reports of two reviewers. Both say revise, and the editor signed revise and resubmit ({\f1 mark1 revise}). Round 2 stops at intake, where the paper's real history ends; the test suite takes a copy of the record through review to a certificate ({\f1 tests/test_journey.py}).\par}
